      <title>Trump-Xi Summit Puts Global AI Race in Focus</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-09-21/bloomberg-tech-9-21-2026-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">33d59a7c87b0e543886d38db</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:53:08 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Bloomberg’s Ed Ludlow breaks down what to expect from the Trump-Xi summit later this week, with AI's role anticipated to be a major part of the agenda for those upcoming talks. Plus, Bloomberg reports Paramount reached a settlement with California and other states suing to block its proposed acquisition of Warner Bros. Discovery. And, as data shows more disruption to US data centers, we get to the political debate with Democratic US Representative Suhas Subramanyam from Virginia. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
